# ── build ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ── private planning documents — NEVER pushed ────────────────────────────────
# Strategy, competitive analysis, licensing reasoning, launch sequence, commercial
# boundaries. The public-safe engineering content is extracted into tracked files:
# CODEBASE.md, docs/laws.md, docs/cli.md, DECISIONS.md, docs/adr/, spec/.
# See docs/source/README.md.
/docs/source/

# ── generated at runtime by the tool itself ──────────────────────────────────
# Receipts for THIS repo are committed deliberately (examples/), but a contributor's
# local scratch receipts are not.
.litmus64/receipts/
.litmus64/cache/

# ── benchmark corpora are fetched, never vendored (xtask corpus sync) ────────
/bench/corpora/**/checkout/

# ── editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json.example
*.swp
